export const title = "AI Event Agent";
export const html = "<h1>AI Event Agent</h1>\n      <hr class=\"rule\" />\n\n<p>AI Event Agent is a program that receives events from AI Bridge, delivers the event content &ndash; including snapshots &ndash; to a PC, and displays it visually. Users can monitor events in real time.</p>\n\n<h2>Installing the Program</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10U_lt_BYvG2tJPJf97Pl0t8r8HOSwvnz?usp=sharing\">AI Event Agent Download</a></p>\n<p>Download the file from the download link, unzip it, and run it.</p>\n\n<h2>Running the Program</h2>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:640px;\">\n<div class=\"app-window\">\n  <div class=\"app-titlebar\"><span>AI Event Agent</span><span>&#8722; &#9633; &times;</span></div>\n  <div style=\"padding:16px 18px;background:#12151c;min-height:220px;\">\n    <div style=\"color:#aeb8cf;font-size:12px;\">&#9776;</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#aeb8cf;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;\">&#128269;</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>AI Event Agent window</figcaption>\n</div>\n<p>Running the program displays the AI Event Agent viewer window.</p>\n<p>Even if you close this window, the program keeps running in the background.</p>\n\n<h2>Checking Connection Information</h2>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:200px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#f2f3f6;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:16px;\">\n  <span>&#128260;</span><span>&#128421;</span><span style=\"background:#d64545;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 4px;\">&#128266;</span>\n</div>\n<figcaption>System tray icon (Windows)</figcaption>\n</div>\n<p>On a Windows PC, you can find the corresponding icon in the taskbar's system tray list.</p>\n<p>Right-click this icon to check the connection information.</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:320px;\">\n<div class=\"modal-mock\">\n  <div class=\"modal-body\" style=\"font-size:12.5px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Access Code: 710147</div>\n    <div>My IP #1: http://192.168.101.10:5000</div>\n    <div>My IP #2: http://192.168.70.5:5000</div>\n    <div>My IP #3: http://192.168.77.78:5000</div>\n    <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:10px 0;\">\n    <div>Font &nbsp; &rsaquo;</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Exit</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>Right-click menu &ndash; Access Code and IP address information</figcaption>\n</div>\n\n<p>The information you need to check here is the <strong>Access Code</strong>, <strong>IP address</strong>, and <strong>Port</strong>.</p>\n<p>An <code>ai_event_agent.ini</code> file is generated in the same location as the AIEventAgent executable. Deleting this file changes the Access Code value.</p>\n<p>If the Access Code value changes, you'll need to reconfigure the AI Bridge action as well.</p>\n\n<h2>Registering with an AI Bridge Action</h2>\n<div class=\"figure\">\n<div class=\"modal-mock\" style=\"max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;\">\n  <div class=\"modal-head\">AI Event Agent Action Setting</div>\n  <div class=\"modal-body\">\n    <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;font-size:12.5px;\">\n      <span>Action Preset Name</span><input value=\"Monitoring PC\" disabled>\n      <span>Remote Address</span><span><input value=\"192.168.101.10\" disabled style=\"width:65%;display:inline-block;\"> <input value=\"5000\" disabled style=\"width:25%;display:inline-block;\"></span>\n      <span>Access Code</span><input value=\"710147\" disabled>\n      <span>Send Example Message</span><span class=\"btn small primary\">Test</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"modal-foot\"><span class=\"btn small\">Cancel</span> <span class=\"btn small primary\">Apply</span></div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>AI Event Agent action settings</figcaption>\n</div>\n\n<p>Enter the Access Code, IP address, and Port you checked above, then configure the settings.</p>\n<p>Clicking the Test button activates the AIEventAgent window, letting it receive a test event.</p>\n\n<h2>Confirming Event Reception</h2>\n<p>When an event occurs, AIEventAgent shows the event's name and snapshot.</p>\n<p>Fully quitting and relaunching AIEventAgent resets the list of received events.</p>\n<p>Fully quitting means right-clicking the background icon and choosing <strong>Exit</strong>.</p>\n<p>Closing the event viewer window does not quit AIEventAgent &ndash; it keeps running in the background.</p>";
